---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/me.jpeg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";

const workExperienceStartingDate = new Date(2021, 1, 3);
const currentDate = Date.now();
const timeDiff = currentDate - workExperienceStartingDate.getTime();
const workExperienceInYears = Math.round(
	timeDiff / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24) / 365,
);
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Just some information about me"
	pubDate={new Date("July 25 2026")}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I am a developer who enjoys running, programming, reading and good
		coffee. Topics I am interested in are: privacy, security and
		programming. I graduated in 2024 with a bachelor's degree in Information and
		Communication Technology from the Ede Christian University of Applied
		Sciences.
	</p>
	<p>
		My journey as a developer started in elementary school when I took a
		course in plain HTML. Later I taught myself Python by downloading public
		domain datasets and analyzing them with Pandas and Numpy. I worked at a
		startup as a full-stack Laravel developer with a focus on back-end and
		quality control. After that I worked as a software tester for a company
		developing workforce management software. Right now I work as a
		full-stack Java/Vue developer for the same company.
	</p>
	<p>
		Below is an overview of my ~{workExperienceInYears} years of work experience:<br />
		<i>(Please note that part time positions are concurrent with internships)</i>
	</p>
	<table class="work-xp">
		<tr>
			<th>Company</th>
			<th>Role</th>
			<th class="employment-type-column">Employment type</th>
			<th class="start-date-column">Start date</th>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Intus Workforce Solutions</td>
			<td>Java Developer</td>
			<td class="employment-type-column">Full Time</td>
			<td class="start-date-column">Nov 01, 2025</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Intus Workforce Solutions</td>
			<td>Software Tester</td>
			<td class="employment-type-column">Full Time</td>
			<td class="start-date-column">Sep 01, 2024</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Nederlandse Voedsel- en Warenautoriteit</td>
			<td>Software Developer</td>
			<td class="employment-type-column">Internship</td>
			<td class="start-date-column">Feb 01, 2024</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Intus Workforce Solutions</td>
			<td>Software Developer</td>
			<td class="employment-type-column">Internship</td>
			<td class="start-date-column">Sep 01, 2023</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Q2-software</td>
			<td>Laravel Developer</td>
			<td class="employment-type-column">Part Time</td>
			<td class="start-date-column">Jul 01, 2022</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Cellro | CNC Automation</td>
			<td>Software Developer</td>
			<td class="employment-type-column">Internship</td>
			<td class="start-date-column">Mar 01, 2022</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Educator</td>
			<td>Support Engineer</td>
			<td class="employment-type-column">Part Time</td>
			<td class="start-date-column">Feb 03, 2021</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
</Layout>
<style>
	table {
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	tr {
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}

	object.email {
		height: 2em;
		margin: -1em 0;
		vertical-align: middle;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		table {
			border-collapse: separate;
		}

		th,
		td {
			box-shadow: 5px 2px 3px lightgray;
			border-radius: 5px;
			border: 2pt;
			border-style: solid;
			padding-left: 5pt;
			border-color: gray;
		}
		.employment-type-column {
			display: none;
		}

		.start-date-column {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>
